'''Battle Items''' are special items that can be bought in the [[Store]] using [[Cat Food]]. They generally improve your performance in [[Battle|battles]], or increase convenience in some fashion. Battle Items can also be gained from [[Gamatoto Expedition]] and dropped in [[Legend Stages]].

